				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "## The dispatcher\n\n{{gtClass:name=BeamEventAnnouncer}} is the GT-side dispatcher. Its `Fanout` view paints the live subscription graph — the dispatcher class, the wildcard default singleton, every per-module announcer, and the receivers grouped by class. Click any node to inspect the actual object."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "pharoSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
