				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "## Coder as source of truth\n\n{{gtClass:name=ElixirModuleCoder}} is the single subscriber to a module's per-module announcer. Its {{gtMethod:name=ElixirModuleCoder>>onBeamModuleRecompiled:}} primes a `cachedFunctionEntries` ivar from the announcement payload, then republishes a local `GtCoderSourceCodeChanged` on its own announcer.\n\nSurfaces that need the new function list ({{gtClass:name=ElixirFunctionStreamingModel}}, {{gtClass:name=ElixirFunctionExpanderAttribute}}, etc.) listen on the coder's local announcer — *not* the global BeamEventAnnouncer — and read from `coder functionEntries` which short-circuits on the cache. One global subscriber per module, regardless of how many surfaces are open."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "pharoSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
